# Soul bytes are integrity-checked byte-for-byte (SOUL_MANIFEST.json) and frozen
# verbatim into new-task runtime state by freezeConfig (src/policy.mjs).
# Pin LF checkout so Windows hosts with core.autocrlf=true produce the exact
# blob bytes; otherwise frozen Soul SHA-256 diverges from the manifest (F-03).
souls/*.md text eol=lf
